{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MINE THE WORLD is a new mining spin-off game by Brilliantcrypto, premium partner of Paris Saint-Germain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's an easy-to-pick up, hard-to-put down game focused on the action of mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes you on an adventure across a variety of regions inspired by the real-world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From frozen mountains and arid deserts to mysterious jungles and the iconic cityscape of Paris, each location offers unique ores, environmental challenges, and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With only your trusty pickaxe in hand, you'll travel the world in search of treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the thrill of discovery and excavation in MINE THE WORLD's global mining adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718380?t=1747130634","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718380/6e29f0217c29e34ba26475bd8220776658c4d84a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747130634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718380/e4ad0bbde3fd00b9951b2e5b23038c9488e58782/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747130634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718380/e4ad0bbde3fd00b9951b2e5b23038c9488e58782/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747130634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MINE THE WORLD is a new mining spin-off game by Brilliantcrypto, premium partner of Paris Saint-Germain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's an easy-to-pick up, hard-to-put down game focused on the action of mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes you on an adventure across a variety of regions inspired by the real-world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From frozen mountains and arid deserts to mysterious jungles and the iconic cityscape of Paris, each location offers unique ores, environmental challenges, and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With only your trusty pickaxe in hand, you'll travel the world in search of treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the thrill of discovery and excavation in MINE THE WORLD's global mining adventure.</p>","developers":["Brilliantcrypto, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718380/564401247d5e47ca5450f15257f6b4d81d4b1c05/header.jpg?t=1747130634","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> HD Graphics 630 or higher</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257134201,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134201/movie480.mp4?t=1746583076","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134201/movie_max.mp4?t=1746583076"},"name":"MINE THE WORLD","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134201/4f1b147f476293a648c14ff9d1743978cc1a7e77/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746583076","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134201/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746583076","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134201/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746583076"}}],"name":"MINE THE WORLD","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> HD Graphics 630 or higher</li></ul>"},"platforms"